(15078,'_site_transient_wp_plugin_dependencies_plugin_data','a:2:{s:14:\"contact-form-7\";a:35:{s:4:\"name\";s:14:\"Contact Form 7\";s:4:\"slug\";s:14:\"contact-form-7\";s:7:\"version\";s:5:\"6.1.4\";s:6:\"author\";s:78:\"<a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rocklobsterinc/\">Rock Lobster Inc.</a>\";s:14:\"author_profile\";s:46:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rocklobsterinc/\";s:12:\"contributors\";a:2:{s:14:\"rocklobsterinc\";a:3:{s:7:\"profile\";s:46:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rocklobsterinc/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/4aa558df1c07e327536d8d0adad6d00fcdca0484c51adf0b867a2aa5ee054bbc?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:17:\"Rock Lobster Inc.\";}s:12:\"takayukister\";a:3:{s:7:\"profile\";s:44:\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/takayukister/\";s:6:\"avatar\";s:120:\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/538487024e649d43dea84ff38d14582d03119e3e7aaaca3b7692443335999133?s=96&d=monsterid&r=g\";s:12:\"display_name\";s:16:\"Takayuki Miyoshi\";}}s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"6.7\";s:6:\"tested\";s:3:\"6.9\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:16:\"requires_plugins\";a:0:{}s:6:\"rating\";i:80;s:7:\"ratings\";a:5:{i:5;i:1448;i:4;i:147;i:3;i:75;i:2;i:68;i:1;i:405;}s:11:\"num_ratings\";i:2143;s:11:\"support_url\";s:52:\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\";s:15:\"support_threads\";i:75;s:24:\"support_threads_resolved\";i:32;s:15:\"active_installs\";i:10000000;s:12:\"last_updated\";s:21:\"2025-11-30 7:47am GMT\";s:5:\"added\";s:10:\"2007-08-02\";s:8:\"homepage\";s:25:\"https://contactform7.com/\";s:8:\"sections\";a:6:{s:11:\"description\";s:3902:\"<p>Contact Form 7 &#8211; це плагін, розроблений як практичний інструмент для всіх користувачів WordPress, які поділяють філософію вільного програмного забезпечення з відкритим кодом. Він використовує складну модульну архітектуру та оригінальну технологію <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/schema-woven-validation/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Schema-Woven Validation</a>.</p>\n<h4>Документація та підтримка</h4>\n<p>Ви можете знайти <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">документи</a>, <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQ</a> тощо детальну інформацію про контактну форму 7 на <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">contactform7.com</a>. Якщо ви не можете знайти відповідь на своє запитання в розділі поширених запитань або в будь-якій документації, відвідайте <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">форум підтримки</a> на WordPress.org. Якщо ви не можете знайти теми, які стосуються вашої конкретної проблеми, опублікуйте для неї нову тему.</p>\n<h4>Contact Form 7 потребує вашої підтримки</h4>\n<p>Важко продовжувати підтримувати цей плагін без підтримки таких користувачів, як ви. Ви можете <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contributing/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">внести свій внесок у проект</a> кількома способами: тестування, кодування, переклад на ваші місцеві мови, допомога іншим користувачам, фінансові пожертви і т.д. Ми однаково вітаємо вас незалежно від того, як ви робите свій внесок.</p>\n<h4>Сповіщення про конфіденційність</h4>\n<p>У стандартній конфігурації, даний плагін сам не буде:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>стежити таємно за користувачами;</li>\n<li>запис будь-яких персональних даних користувача в базу даних;</li>\n<li>надсилання будь-яких даних на зовнішні сервери;</li>\n<li>використовуйте cookies.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Якщо ви активуєте певні функції в цьому плагіні, особисті дані відправника контактної форми, включаючи його IP-адресу, можуть бути відправлені постачальнику послуг. Таким чином, рекомендується підтвердити політику конфіденційності постачальника. Ці функції включають в себе:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>reCAPTCHA (<a href=\"https://policies.google.com/?hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Google</a>)</li>\n<li>Akismet (<a href=\"https://automattic.com/privacy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Automattic</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.constantcontact.com/legal/privacy-center\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Постійний контакт</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.brevo.com/legal/privacypolicy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Brevo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://stripe.com/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Stripe</a></li>\n<li>Turnstile (<a href=\"https://www.cloudflare.com/turnstile-privacy-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Cloudflare</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\";s:12:\"installation\";s:662:\"<ol>\n<li>Завантажте папку <code>contact-form-7</code> в директорію <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Активуйте плагін через розділ <strong>Плагіни</strong> (<strong>Плагіни &gt; Встановлені плагіни</strong>).</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Ви знайдете меню <strong>Контакти</strong> в розділі адміністратора WordPress.</p>\n<p>Для базового використання ви також можете подивитися на <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">домашню сторінку плагіну</a>.</p>\n\";s:3:\"faq\";s:539:\"<p>У вас є питання або проблеми з Contact Form 7? Використовуйте ці канали підтримки.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Документація</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/faq/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQ</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/contact-form-7/\" rel=\"ugc\">Форум підтримки</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/support/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Підтримка</a></p>\n\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:2086:\"<p>Для отримання додаткової інформації, дивіться <a href=\"https://contactform7.com/category/releases/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Релізи</a>.</p>\n<h4>6.1.4</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-614/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-614/</a></p>\n<h4>6.1.3</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-613/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-613/</a></p>\n<h4>6.1.2</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-612/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-612/</a></p>\n<h4>6.1.1</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-611/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-611/</a></p>\n<h4>6.1</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-61/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-61/</a></p>\n<h4>6.0.5</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-605/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-605/</a></p>\n<h4>6.0.4</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-604/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-604/</a></p>\n<h4>6.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Оновлений рік дії авторського права до 2025</li>\n<li>Оновлює вміст повідомлення &#8220;Contact Form 7 потребує вашої підтримки&#8221;.</li>\n<li>Оновлює попередження про застарілість Постійного контакту.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Видаляє непотрібні оголошення типів з нульових аргументів, щоб уникнути попереджень про застарілість у PHP 8.4.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>6.0.1</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-601/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-601/</a></p>\n<h4>6.0</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-60/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://contactform7.com/contact-form-7-60/</a></p>\n\";s:11:\"screenshots\";s:225:\"<ol><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\" alt=\"screenshot-1.png\"></a><p>screenshot-1.png</p></li></ol>\";s:7:\"reviews\";s:16154:\"<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Not simple enough</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"2 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"2\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/whiteelephantagency/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d77da09e583e1566e62273a5270a884532349a7304b61f04956dfd6b4a919f5d?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d77da09e583e1566e62273a5270a884532349a7304b61f04956dfd6b4a919f5d?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/whiteelephantagency/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">whiteelephantagency</a> о <span class=\"review-date\">26 Листопада, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Out of the box form with very little support and features. I\'ve always had issues with deliverability. I think they really shuold upgrade the interface and make it easier to actually create the forms. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Thank you</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/mjhabib4/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7846a00a11bed7886213dcbc07a83a13bc051b29eecb488b476b78558e57264a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7846a00a11bed7886213dcbc07a83a13bc051b29eecb488b476b78558e57264a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/mjhabib4/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">MJ Habib <small>(mjhabib4)</small></a> о <span class=\"review-date\">30 Жовтня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact Form 7 remains one of my go-to form plugins because it’s simple, reliable, and flexible. Even though it\'s been around for years, it still works smoothly across themes and handles basic to moderately complex forms with ease. I appreciate its stability and commitment to free and open source.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Quiz (form field) only loads sometimes.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/braads/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21a0e98a004178f29b071eff54cc482a2f4611eab3ee615cbaa59c428e4d8a8f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/21a0e98a004178f29b071eff54cc482a2f4611eab3ee615cbaa59c428e4d8a8f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/braads/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Brad <small>(braads)</small></a> о <span class=\"review-date\">22 Жовтня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I\'ve added a quiz to the contact form to prevent spam.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sometimes the quiz (form field) loads, sometimes (well, most of the time) it doesn\'t. Very frustrating.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s probably time for a new plugin. Contact Form 7 is now outdated.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/hiroshixo/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8ebc923f62bf4bc5c819c678bcd0f3e97beb55682b0da5498deaff72f2201f7f?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8ebc923f62bf4bc5c819c678bcd0f3e97beb55682b0da5498deaff72f2201f7f?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/hiroshixo/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Hiroshi <small>(hiroshixo)</small></a> о <span class=\"review-date\">9 Жовтня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is a great plugin, which I always use on almost all my websites. It just works. 👍</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Fantastic Plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/nolanrichardson/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/00655133aac26f5bf75c73c0e19b965aea6a8758fe43d0899a529bb25c9a6d08?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/00655133aac26f5bf75c73c0e19b965aea6a8758fe43d0899a529bb25c9a6d08?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/nolanrichardson/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">nolanrichardson</a> о <span class=\"review-date\">2 Жовтня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It keeps things simple and functional</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">WordPress classic</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/diegobittencourt/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/57f994681397b666aadbdad1ab144ffef2ccbc3fe32f71a8bf23b8d2dfd03a0c?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/57f994681397b666aadbdad1ab144ffef2ccbc3fe32f71a8bf23b8d2dfd03a0c?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/diegobittencourt/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Diego Bittencourt <small>(diegobittencourt)</small></a> о <span class=\"review-date\">30 Серпня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Great contribution to community just like Flamingo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Gets the job done, nothing more</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"3 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/waynebaker/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f8eec87fbd6c81d566c496bdacf5af570c8fa541835cdbe34ab8977fdabecd1e?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f8eec87fbd6c81d566c496bdacf5af570c8fa541835cdbe34ab8977fdabecd1e?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/waynebaker/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Wayne Baker <small>(waynebaker)</small></a> о <span class=\"review-date\">26 Серпня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It’s fine for basic use, but don’t expect advanced features. The plugin feels a bit plain, though it remains dependable for simple contact needs.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Best plugin in wp.org</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/kateham/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8a3016aeb320c1b6761c4d71d89538456506e66213dc7722b3e58c71fc0a2eed?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8a3016aeb320c1b6761c4d71d89538456506e66213dc7722b3e58c71fc0a2eed?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/kateham/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">kateham</a> о <span class=\"review-date\">12 Серпня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>idk if the author is japanese but this plugin looks like japanese. simple, elegant, strong, reliable, CLEAN!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>wp should hire this person to direct wp </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>thank you </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Simple, Reliable, and Perfect for Custom Forms</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rahultank/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/892e8b6ae452e50cb38e97c20e35070bc127e587555a0433b96edeff98bcb348?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/892e8b6ae452e50cb38e97c20e35070bc127e587555a0433b96edeff98bcb348?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/rahultank/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Rahul Tank <small>(rahultank)</small></a> о <span class=\"review-date\">12 Серпня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Contact Form 7 is simple yet powerful. It’s lightweight, works well with most themes, and gives full control over form fields through short codes. Great for basic contact forms without heavy overhead. However, styling requires a bit of custom CSS, and advanced features may need extra plugins. Overall, a reliable choice for anyone who wants a free, no-frills form solution.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Absolutely love the contact form 7</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 з 5 зірок\" data-title-template=\"%s з 5 зірок\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				Від <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/hurtadodoo/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/de1429f34dfc965361e4bfd86e9a66de34e9d61a5ce47ec25fe10ab034552f56?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/de1429f34dfc965361e4bfd86e9a66de34e9d61a5ce47ec25fe10ab034552f56?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/hurtadodoo/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">hurtadodoo</a> о <span class=\"review-date\">10 Серпня, 2025</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Absolutely love the contact form plugin works perfectly out of the box, easy to customize, and looks good on all devices. The spam protection is also surprisingly effective.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:111:\"Просто ще один плагін контактної форми. Простий, але гнучкий.\";s:13:\"download_link\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.6.1.4.zip\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:67:\"https://ps.w.org/contact-form-7/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=1176454\";s:7:\"caption\";s:16:\"screenshot-1.png\";}}s:4:\"tags\";a:2:{s:12:\"contact-form\";s:12:\"contact form\";s:23:\"schema-woven-validation\";s:23:\"schema-woven validation\";}s:8:\"versions\";a:201:{s:3:\"1.1\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.1.zip\";s:4:\"1.10\";s:62:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.10.zip\";s:8:\"1.10.0.1\";s:66:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.10.0.1.zip\";s:6:\"1.10.1\";s:64:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.10.1.zip\";s:3:\"1.2\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.2.zip\";s:3:\"1.3\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.3.zip\";s:5:\"1.3.1\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.3.1.zip\";s:5:\"1.3.2\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.3.2.zip\";s:3:\"1.4\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.4.zip\";s:5:\"1.4.1\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.4.1.zip\";s:5:\"1.4.2\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.4.2.zip\";s:5:\"1.4.3\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.4.3.zip\";s:5:\"1.4.4\";s:63:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/contact-form-7.1.4.4.zip\";s:3:\"1.5\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpr