r course content over from LearnPress, Tutor LMS or Sensei LMS.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/learndash-default_256x256-3.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/learndash-default_256x256-3.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256-3.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:6:\"4.10.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:39:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/migration/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:21:\"learndash, migration,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"learndash-migration\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:22:\"learndash-achievements\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:28:\"LearnDash LMS - Achievements\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:142;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"2.0.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:95:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-achievements/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-09-03 15:13:58\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:127:\"<div>\r\n<div>Award badges and points to users for the successful completion of LearnDash and WordPress activities.</div>\r\n</div>\";s:12:\"installation\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:2528:\"<strong>2.0.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Feature - Add support for LearnDash Registration &quot;Modern&quot; variation.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added filter: <code>learndash_registration_variation</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Feature - Added &quot;User has logged in for X consecutive days&quot; trigger.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added &quot;User has completed X courses/groups&quot; trigger.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added &quot;User has earned X badges or points&quot; trigger.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added achievements data in WordPress Personal Data Export and Erasure.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added points to &quot;My Achievements&quot; shortcode and block output.</li>\n<li>Feature - Positionable pop up notice when completing a trigger.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved &#039;Quiz score above %&#039; trigger not scoring correctly.</li>\n<li>Fix - Fixed unnecessary achievements tab always appear on courses list page.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added functions: <code>learndash_achievements_extra_autoloading</code>, <code>learndash_achievements_extra_includes</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added actions: <code>learndash_achievements_after_create_achievement</code>, <code>learndash_achievements_after_delete_achievements</code>, <code>learndash_achievements_before_delete_achievements</code>, <code>learndash_achievements_uninstall</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added filters: <code>learndash_achievements_trigger_action_is_valid</code>, <code>learndash_achievements_trigger_classes</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Updated filters: <code>learndash_achievements_languages_directory</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.2.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Blocks not displaying correctly in editor.</li>\n<li>Fix - Allow course purchase with achievement points.</li>\n<li>Fix - Remove placeholder text on course settings page.</li>\n<li>Fix - PHP errors when submitting a quiz.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.2.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added - Badge descriptions on leaderboard</li>\n<li>Fix - Re-enable points system on leaderboard</li>\n<li>Fix - Earned points not calculating correctly</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added group leaders can now see achievements of their students</li>\n<li>Added users can now use achievement points to purchase a course </li>\n<li>Added trigger for awarding an achievement if a quiz score is above a set percentage</li>\n<li>Added restrict achievements to a specific LearnDash group</li>\n<li>Updated the achievement image is now optional </li>\n<li>Updated achievement badge icons can now be set to a larger size</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:101:\"Award badges and points to users for the successful completion of LearnDash and WordPress activities.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/learndash-default_banner-1.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/learndash-default_banner-1.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256-1.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:25:\"http://www.learndash.com/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"learndash-achievements\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:6:\"ld-tec\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:47:\"LearnDash LMS - The Events Calendar Integration\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:117;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.0.2\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:79:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/ld-tec/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-08-13 15:12:50\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:74:\"<div>\r\n<div>Integrate LearnDash LMS with The Events Calendar</div>\r\n</div>\";s:12:\"installation\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:479:\"<strong>1.0.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Remove extra input fields when editing an event.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added actions: <code>learndash_tec_uninstall</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added functions: <code>learndash_tec_extra_autoloading</code>, <code>learndash_tec_extra_includes</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Deprecated functions: <code>LearnDash\\the_events_calendar</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.1</strong><br/>\n<br/><strong>1.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:48:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with The Events Calendar\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/learndash-default_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/07/learndash-default_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:86:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:6:\"ld-tec\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:19:\"learndash-integrity\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"LearnDash LMS - Integrity\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:114;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.2.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:92:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-integrity/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-10-23 10:37:04\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:47:\"Protect your LearnDash site from content theft.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1329:\"<strong>1.2.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Fixed captcha.</li>\n<li>Fix - Fixed browser console warning when Recaptcha v2 is enabled.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added actions: <code>learndash_integrity_uninstall</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added functions: <code>learndash_integrity_extra_autoloading</code>, <code>learndash_integrity_extra_includes</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Deprecated functions: <code>learndash_integrity</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.2.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Allow pasting in password input fields when content copy protection enabled</li>\n<li>Fix - Allow recaptcha to display on non-LD pages when using the Login menu item</li>\n<li>Fix - Show recaptcha in login modal when used with LearnDash Login block</li>\n<li>Tweak - Address PHP 8.2 warnings</li>\n<li>Tweak - Updated recaptcha setup instructions</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added remove hotlinking protection from .htaccess file on plugin deactivation</li>\n<li>Added user role selector for concurent login protection to be able to exclude user roles from protection</li>\n<li>Updated remove login transients when clearing session from user profile</li>\n<li>Fixed display of captcha box</li>\n<li>Fixed captcha setup instructions for clearer user experience</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:47:\"Protect your LearnDash site from content theft.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/learndash-default_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/learndash-default_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:86:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"learndash-integrity\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:17:\"learndash-samcart\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:35:\"LearnDash LMS - Samcart Integration\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:74;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.1.0\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:90:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-samcart/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2022-08-01 14:58:28\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:629:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Samcart.\r\n\r\nSamCart is a hosted shopping cart built by marketers, for marketers. It is optimized for conversions so as to increase your total revenue. This integration makes it possible to sell LearnDash courses with this high-converting shopping cart.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Automatic account creation</li>\r\n 	<li>Easily map courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Associate one, or multiple courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Works with any SamCart payment gateway</li>\r\n 	<li>Works with Subscriptions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://www.learndash.com/add-on/samcart/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:534:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\nDeactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\nDownload the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\nUpload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\nActivate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:265:\"<strong>1.1.0</strong><br/><p>= 1.1.0 =</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Added filter hook to control process<em>notification</em>url</li>\n<li>Added dependency check</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined index error</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Initial Release *</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:38:\"Integrates LearnDash LMS with Samcart.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-samcart_banner-1.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:2:{i:0;s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-samcart_banner-1.jpg\";i:1;s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-samcart_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-samcart_256x256-1.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"tags\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"learndash-samcart\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:24:\"learndash-event-espresso\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:28:\"Event Espresso for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:73;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.1.0\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:97:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-event-espresso/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.9\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2022-03-28 14:30:41\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:747:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Event Espresso.\r\n\r\nEvent Espresso is the leading live event and ticket management solution for WordPress. With this integration, you can associate your online courses to live events so that when users register, they are auto-enrolled. Perfect for anyone offering live training, seminars, or classrooms.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Easily map an event to a course</li>\r\n 	<li>Associate one, or many, courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Drip-feed course content leading up to an event</li>\r\n 	<li>Works with any Event Espresso payment gateway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nNote: this integration requires Event Espresso v4 or higher.\r\n\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/event-espresso/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:110:\"<strong>1.1.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added language directory and POT file</li>\n<li>Added constants</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:44:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Event Espresso.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:92:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-event-espresso_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:92:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-event-espresso_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:95:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-event-espresso_256x256-1.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"2.5\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:44:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/event-espresso/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:35:\"integration, event, event espresso,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:24:\"learndash-event-espresso\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:30:\"learndash-restrict-content-pro\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:34:\"Restrict Content Pro for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:72;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.1.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:103:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-restrict-content-pro/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.9\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2023-07-03 18:34:23\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:160:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Restrict Content Pro.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1087:\"<strong>1.1.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Retroactive process on existing membership.</li>\n<li>Fix - Free membership subscription triggers user enrollment for manual paid membership.</li>\n<li>Fix - Support RCP Group Accounts addon.</li>\n<li>Fix - Unenroll user upon membership expiration instead of membership cancellation.</li>\n<li>Fix - Allow retroactive tool to be run at any point in time.</li>\n<li>Fix - Potential timeout issue when processing course access during cron job.</li>\n<li>Fix - Support for LearnDash Groups enrollment.</li>\n<li>Fix - User losing course access after more than one membership providing access to a course and the user losing access to at least one membership.</li>\n<li>Fix - Update course access when switching between memberships.</li>\n<li>Fix - Remove course access upon membership expiration.</li>\n<li>Fix - Enroll into course after successful payment verification.</li>\n<li>Fix - Fatal error when using PHP 8.0.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added RCP 3.0 compatibility hook function</li>\n<li>Fixed course association</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:50:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Restrict Content Pro.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:98:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-restrict-content-pro_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:98:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-restrict-content-pro_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:99:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-restrict-content-pro_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"2.5\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"tags\";s:46:\"integration, membership, restrict content pro,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:30:\"learndash-restrict-content-pro\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:23:\"learndash-gravity-forms\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Gravity Forms for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:71;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"2.1.3\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:96:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-gravity-forms/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2022-10-28 12:09:13\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:666:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Gravity Forms.\r\n\r\nGravity Forms is hands-down the industry\'s best custom form development plugin.\r\n\r\nWith this integration, you can create a completely custom course registration form and associate your online courses to it so that when users register, they are auto-enrolled.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Create a unique registration form</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatically enrolls user</li>\r\n 	<li>Accept payments using Gravity Forms add-ons</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nNote: this integration requires a Developer License from Gravity Forms.\r\n\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/gravity-forms/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:534:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\nDeactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\nDownload the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\nUpload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\nActivate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1028:\"<strong>2.1.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Updated improve LD GF select2 box styling</li>\n<li>Updated add horizontal padding to LD option input field</li>\n<li>Updated improve style of LD options select box in GF field choices</li>\n<li>Updated use entry form feed setting to make its filter hook works instead of pulling feed settings from DB</li>\n<li>Fixed editor CSS styles are broken because of jQuery UI base theme CSS</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined array index error</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect property name is JS script</li>\n<li>Fixed JS conflict error on form edit screen</li>\n<li>Fixed selecting options in LD options select box for GF field choices close GF choices UI flyout</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.1.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added ability to assign a LearnDash group</li>\n<li>Added allow conditional group enrollment based upon a form input</li>\n<li>Added ability to support Gravity Forms conditonal logic </li>\n<li>Fixed PHP notice</li>\n<li>Fixed users not being enrolled when a Stripe payment field is part of the form</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:44:\"Integrates LearnDash LMS with Gravity Forms.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:91:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-gravity-forms_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:91:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-gravity-forms_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:86:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:43:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/gravity-forms/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:26:\"integration, gravity forms\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"learndash-gravity-forms\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:13:\"learndash-edd\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"EDD for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:70;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.4.0\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:86:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-edd/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2023-04-12 18:55:49\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:574:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Easy Digital Downloads.\r\n\r\nEasy Digital Downloads is a popular shopping cart for WordPress with over 400,000 downloads. This integration makes it possible to sell LearnDash created courses using the Easy Digital Downloads shopping cart.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Easy course mapping</li>\r\n 	<li>Associate one, or multiple courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Auto-User Enrollment</li>\r\n 	<li>Works with any payment gateway</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/easy-digital-downloads/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1491:\"<strong>1.4.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Feature: Add support for EDD pro.</li>\n<li>Feature: Add variable pricing support for LearnDash course and group enrollment.</li>\n<li>Feature: Add retroactive tool based on EDD purchase and subscription.</li>\n<li>Feature: Add subscription completed handler and filter hook that allows access removal.</li>\n<li>Feature: Add user cancelled subscription check for expired subscription.</li>\n<li>Feature: Add subscription failing hook handler.</li>\n<li>Fix: Add backward compatibility with LD EDD &lt;= 1.3.0 for variable products.</li>\n<li>Fix: Fix course access is given on any subscription update action.</li>\n<li>Fix: Add compatibility with EDD free downloads extension.</li>\n<li>Fix: Change course and group selector select fields to select2.</li>\n<li>Fix: Add EDD settings section on LD advanced settings page.</li>\n<li>Fix: Users don&#039;t get access to LD course/group after completing purchase using unregistered user.</li>\n<li>Fix: Variable product course selector doesn&#039;t work because of selector change in EDD 3.0.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.3.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added LearnDash group support </li>\n<li>Updated user course access is attched to each product rather than the overall order allowing refunds of individual products whilst retaining access to others</li>\n<li>Updated updating product’s related courses will update existing customers course access</li>\n<li>Fixed PHP warnings </li>\n<li>Fixed broken metabox styling</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:53:\"Integrates LearnDash LMS with Easy Digital Downloads.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:81:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-edd_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:81:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-edd_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:82:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-edd_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:52:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/easy-digital-downloads/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:29:\"integration, membership, edd,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:13:\"learndash-edd\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:17:\"learndash-bbpress\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"bbPress for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:69;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"2.2.4\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:90:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-bbpress/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-03-04 16:19:33\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:656:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with bbPress.\r\n\r\nbbPress is a forum plugin for WordPress with over 1.5 million downloads. This integration makes it easy for you to add forums to your courses. You can protect the forums so that only users who are enrolled into your courses are able to view content and to post new threads &amp; topics.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Automatic forum access</li>\r\n 	<li>Public or private forums</li>\r\n 	<li>Multi-forum support</li>\r\n 	<li>Custom Access Denied messages</li>\r\n 	<li>Dynamic associated forum widget</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/bbpress/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:534:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\nDeactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\nDownload the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\nUpload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\nActivate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:855:\"<strong>2.2.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Security - Improve security for <code>ld_bbpress_forum_objects</code> shortcode.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.2.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Forum widget no longer lists all forums when on a quiz page.</li>\n<li>Fix - Invalid supplied argument error when using Forum Course widget.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.2.2</strong><br/><p>= 2.2.2 =</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed setting field labels don&#039;t point to their fields</li>\n<li>Fixed some formatting and improved variable names</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect and refactor forum access check logic</li>\n<li>Fixed custom message on topic page doesn&#039;t follow forum setting</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.2.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added dependency check</li>\n<li>Added LearnDash group support</li>\n<li>Updated post limit message for group</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined error notices</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:37:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with bbPress.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-bbpress_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-bbpress_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:86:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-bbpress_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:5:\"3.0.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:37:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/bbpress/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:29:\"bbpress, forums, integrations\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"learndash-bbpress\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:15:\"ld-multilingual\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:34:\"LearnDash Multilingual Integration\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:68;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.0.0\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:88:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/ld-multilingual/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2022-03-28 14:33:10\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:295:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with WPML and Polylang.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Compatibility with course and quiz builder</li>\r\n 	<li>Translatable URLs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://www.learndash.com/support/docs/add-ons/compatibility/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:63:\"<strong>1.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:57:\"Adds Multilingual support with WPML and Polylang plugins.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_banner-1.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_banner-1.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256-1.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:22:\"https://learndash.com/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:41:\"integration, translations, wpml, polylang\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"ld-multilingual\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:21:\"learndash-memberpress\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"MemberPress for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:67;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"2.2.2\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:94:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-memberpress/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2022-10-19 15:57:34\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:718:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with MemberPress.\r\n\r\nMemberPress is a premium WordPress membership plugin that excels in memberships, grouping, coupons, reminders, reports, and more.\r\n\r\nWith this integration you can create membership levels in MemberPress and associate the access levels to LearnDash courses. Customers are then auto-enrolled into courses after signing-up for membership.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Associate membership levels to one or more courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatic removal upon membership cancellation</li>\r\n 	<li>Create trial membership levels with various payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/memberpress/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:536:\"<strong>2.2.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Updated get live subscription of user rather than cached version</li>\n<li>Updated run expire subscription access in silent queue and update access</li>\n<li>Fixed retroactive tool on multisite installs</li>\n<li>Fixed retroactive tool resetting user access counter on each run</li>\n<li>Fixed error when deactivating plugin</li>\n<li>Fixed unregistered cron events on plugin deactivation</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.2.1.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed free trial subscriptions not enrolling users</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:41:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with MemberPress.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:89:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-memberpress_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:89:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-memberpress_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:90:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-memberpress_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:41:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/memberpress/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:37:\"integration, membership, memberpress,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"learndash-memberpress\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:20:\"learndash-thrivecart\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"ThriveCart for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:66;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.0.3\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:93:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-thrivecart/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-04-17 14:42:02\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:690:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Thrivecart.\r\n\r\nThriveCart is a powerful eCommerce solution for selling digital products with features such as order bumps and upsells.\r\nWith this integration you can create products in ThirveCart and then create a product in WordPress and associate it with a LearnDash courses. Customers are then auto-enrolled into courses after payment.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Supports all ThriveCart functionality including order bumps and upsells</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatic enrollment upon successful payment</li>\r\n 	<li>Coupon and discount support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/thrivecart/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:804:\"<strong>1.0.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Deprecate - Classes: <code>LearnDash\\Elementor\\Container</code>, <code>LearnDash\\Elementor\\App</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added compatibility with LearnDash Core v4.13.0.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Updated functions: <code>learndash_thrivecart_extra_autoloading</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Feature - Add setting to allow user to set partial refund behavior.</li>\n<li>Fix - Remove access when subscription ends, not when cancelled.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Update <code>learndash_thrivecart_after_create_user</code> action to include $password argument.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added <code>learndash_thrivecart_process_webhook</code> filter.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Initial release  </li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:41:\"Integrates LearnDash LMS with Thrivecart.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_banner-2.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_banner-2.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256-2.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:5:\"4.7.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:40:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/thrivecart/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:24:\"integration, thrivecart,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:20:\"learndash-thrivecart\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:19:\"learndash-elementor\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Elementor for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:65;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:7:\"1.0.9.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:92:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-elementor/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-06-20 15:01:44\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:253:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Elementor.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Native Elementor templates and widgets</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://www.learndash.com/support/docs/add-ons/compatibility/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:2488:\"<strong>1.0.9.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Resolved fatal error when required dependency plugins are not active.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.9</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - [ld_video] shortcode tag is inserted as duplicate in single lesson and single topic templates when video progression is enabled.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved issue where quiz post content doesn&#039;t appear for enrolled users.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved conflicts with addons that utilize LearnDash page&#039;s tabs element.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added action: <code>learndash_elementor_uninstall</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.8</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Deprecate - Classes: <code>LearnDash\\Elementor\\Container</code>, <code>LearnDash\\Elementor\\App</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added compatibility with LearnDash Core v4.13.0.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Updated functions: <code>learndash_elementor_extra_autoloading</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.7</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Show step content when not assigned to a course.</li>\n<li>Fix - Show quiz content on global single quiz template.</li>\n<li>Fix - Show quiz content when using shortcode in template.</li>\n<li>Fix - Undefined array key - &quot;globals/typography?id=secondary&quot;.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.6</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added - Disable auto insert widgets setting.</li>\n<li>Fix - Prevent templates from duplicating on refresh.</li>\n<li>Fix - Automatically load course certificate/content/infobar widgets in template if widgets not inserted.</li>\n<li>Fix - Steps content not displaying for non admin users.</li>\n<li>Fix - Video progression content not displaying when using Elementor Pro.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Updated deprecated functions from LearnDash core</li>\n<li>Fixed LearnDash shortcode button not working in Elementor Text Editor widget</li>\n<li>Fixed allowing access to scheduled lessons</li>\n<li>Fixed deprecated <em>register</em>controls function from Elementor</li>\n<li>Fixed Quiz List Topics filter showing lessons instead of topics</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed PHP notices/warnings</li>\n<li>Fixed LearnDash Elementor widgets not appearing when other Elementor add-ons are active</li>\n<li>Fixed Lesson content not showing for some users</li>\n<li>Fixed Unlimited quiz retries when using an Elementor quiz template</li>\n<li>Fixed LearnDash shortcode wizard not working in Elementor text element</li>\n<li>Removed &quot;Show Progress Bar” on Lesson, Topic, and Quiz list widgets </li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:75:\"LearnDash LMS add-on to add support native Elementor templates and widgets.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:0:\"\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:0:{}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_256x256-3.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:22:\"https://learndash.com/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"learndash-elementor\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:21:\"learndash-course-grid\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:21:\"LearnDash Course Grid\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:64;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:6:\"2.0.10\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:94:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-course-grid/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-11-06 12:31:36\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:676:\"The Course Grid add-on gives you the ability to create a responsive course library that can be inserted on any page or post of your site. This is a perfect feature if you have a variety of course offerings and want to give users the ability to filter through them by category.\r\n<h4>Add-on Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Responsive grid layout of courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Filtering by category</li>\r\n 	<li>Display course featured image and short description</li>\r\n 	<li>Featured video support</li>\r\n 	<li>Dynamic course price listing</li>\r\n 	<li>Dynamic course status listing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/course-grid/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:4012:\"<strong>2.0.10</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Resolved a 404 HTTP error for an asset URL on a course editing page.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved an issue where the default taxonomies filter was not applied on the front end.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved PHP deprecated errors.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.9</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix: Price filter still showing when set to false using shortcode.</li>\n<li>Fix: All courses displaying when query set to not-enrolled when enrolled into all courses.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.8</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Update: Add custom ColorPalette component and replace default Gutenberg ColorPalette component.</li>\n<li>Fix: Fix changing a duplicated block style also change the style of its original block.</li>\n<li>Fix: Fix fatal error if the site doesn&#039;t have default course category or terms set up.</li>\n<li>Fix: Fix double path separator issue.</li>\n<li>Fix: PHP error notice.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.7</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Updated in-app documentation text</li>\n<li>Fixed Styles component error in block</li>\n<li>Fixed overflown video width</li>\n<li>Fixed DB query for multisite install</li>\n<li>Fixed fatal error with Elementor page</li>\n<li>Fixed color picker component doesn&#039;t have clear value button</li>\n<li>Fixed duplicating course grid block and changing styles of one block also changes style of other block</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.6</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added translation support for block strings</li>\n<li>Updated added back learndash<em>course</em>grid<em>custom</em>button_text filter hook</li>\n<li>Fixed missing course grid translations</li>\n<li>Fixed slow queries in sites with a large number of users (10,000+)</li>\n<li>Fixed allow max/min prices to be empty</li>\n<li>Fixed correctly set max-min width </li>\n<li>Fixed shortcodes having additional parameters in their tag</li>\n<li>Fixed don&#039;t show ribbon if course is closed or has no price</li>\n<li>Fixed grids not displaying correctly in Elementor</li>\n<li>Fixed skin and card assets not correctly loading in Elementor</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect shared steps URL</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect variable type for implode</li>\n<li>Fixed meta box styling</li>\n<li>Fixed skins and cards not being filterable</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect post results if taxonomies attribute values are wrapped in quotes</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.5</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added pre-defined taxonomies in filter dropdown</li>\n<li>Added support for new global currency in LearnDash core</li>\n<li>Added LearnDash specific selector for CSS to avoid conflicts</li>\n<li>Updated improve ribbon text logic</li>\n<li>Fixed conflict with other plugins that execute the_content() on the front-end</li>\n<li>Fixed taxonomies filter not being able to have more than 1 working term</li>\n<li>Fixed enrolled courses query returning all courses for logged out users</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined functions</li>\n<li>Fixed remove box sizing CSS rule to avoid conflicts with other themes/plugins</li>\n<li>Fixed masonry styles not working correctly </li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added icon supported element for cards</li>\n<li>Added conditional for element color selector</li>\n<li>Added custom color selector for ribbon, icon, and button elements</li>\n<li>Updated not started label text on CG 2.0 templates based on user activity for LD lesson and topic post type</li>\n<li>Updated not Started label based on user activity for lesson and topic</li>\n<li>Fixed card layouts and styles</li>\n<li>Fixed minor cards layout and CSS styles</li>\n<li>Fixed block editor meta setting value is not passed to front end templates</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect variable name</li>\n<li>Fixed translations meta box on translations setting page is not loaded</li>\n<li>Fixed update translations metabox to match with plugin name</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined index error</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined JS function</li>\n<li>Fixed missing translation slug</li>\n<li>Fixed legacy v1 course grid is not detected if the shortcode already stored in HTML format in DB</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:79:\"Transform the course list created with shortcode [ld_course_list] to grid view.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:89:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-course-grid_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:89:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-course-grid_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:92:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-course-grid_256x256-1.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:41:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/course-grid/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:19:\"grid, view, display\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"learndash-course-grid\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:23:\"learndash-notifications\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"LearnDash Notifications\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:63;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.6.4\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:96:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-notifications/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-04-17 14:43:39\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:688:\"Send email notifications based on LearnDash actions.\r\n\r\nThis add-on enables a new level of learner engagement within your LearnDash courses. Configure various notifications to be sent out automatically based on what learners do (and do not do) in a course.\r\n\r\nThis is a perfect tool for bolstering learner engagement, encouragement, promotions, and cross-selling.\r\n<h4>Add-on Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Automatically Send Notifications</li>\r\n 	<li>13 Available Triggers</li>\r\n 	<li>34 Dynamic Shortcodes</li>\r\n 	<li>Delay Notifications</li>\r\n 	<li>Choose Recipients</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/learndash-notifications/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:4328:\"<strong>1.6.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Deprecate - Classes: <code>LearnDash\\Notifications\\Container</code>, <code>LearnDash\\Notifications\\App</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added compatibility with LearnDash Core v4.13.0.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Updated functions: <code>learndash_notifications_extra_autoloading</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.6.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - &quot;User hasn&#039;t completed a quiz&quot; condition field doesn&#039;t have additional options.</li>\n<li>Fix - &quot;X days before course expires&quot; trigger doesn&#039;t work as expected.</li>\n<li>Fix - User enrolled into course notification is not triggered when a user is enroll via LD Zapier app course enrollment action.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.6.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Feature - Add &quot;Exclude pre-ordered course&quot; option on Enroll into a course trigger.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Better object select2 fields (course, lesson, etc) search results to support pagination.</li>\n<li>Fix - Undefined array key error on Essay question has been put into graded status trigger.</li>\n<li>Fix - Any object option in object field (course, lesson, etc) not saving.</li>\n<li>Fix - Fatal error when using Assignment has been uploaded trigger and Assignment has been uploaded condition.</li>\n<li>Fix - A scheduled lesson is available to user email not sending.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.6.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added - New action hooks &#039;learndash<em>notifications</em>email<em>sent&#039; and &#039;learndash</em>notifications<em>email</em>failed&#039;.</li>\n<li>Fixed - Triggering objects settings in notification model don&#039;t work correctly filtering events that triggers set up notifications.</li>\n<li>Fixed - User can&#039;t select specific quiz associated with a lesson because quiz was only direct child to topic. Now it can be direct child of course, lesson, or topic.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.6.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added - Multi triggers/conditions support</li>\n<li>Added - &#039;learndash<em>notifications</em>subscription<em>page</em>slug&#039; filter to modify subscriptions page slug</li>\n<li>Fix - Disable course fields when using quiz trigger</li>\n<li>Fix - Send single email instead of multiple for &quot;User hasn&#039;t logged in for X days&quot; trigger when multiple courses are involved</li>\n<li>Fix - Reschedule drip lesson when user enroll date changes</li>\n<li>Fix - &quot;User hasn&#039;t logged in for X days&quot; trigger correctly sends to users now</li>\n<li>Fix - Prevent &quot;A scheduled lesson is available to user&quot; notifications sending from wrong course</li>\n<li>Fix - Display specified course lessons in notifications page listing column</li>\n<li>Fix - User receives quiz failed notification when quiz not failed</li>\n<li>Fix - Group leaders not receiving emails for groups they are leaders of</li>\n<li>Fix - Allow group URL in notifications shortcodes</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.5.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added AJAX search support on notifications list posts filter</li>\n<li>Added improve LD posts selector logic especially for site with big number of courses, lessons, etc</li>\n<li>Added change post selectors in notification metabox to use select2 and dynamic AJAX options</li>\n<li>Updated update LearnDash strings using LD custom label</li>\n<li>Updated use learndash<em>quiz</em>submitted action hook instead of learndash<em>quiz</em>completed</li>\n<li>Fixed make sure retrieved group leaders has group leader role</li>\n<li>Fixed before course expires notification is sent before set value</li>\n<li>Fixed Make sure pre selected value is selected on edit screen</li>\n<li>Fixed group selector returns empty result</li>\n<li>Fixed use learndash<em>emails</em>send insteand of wp_mail to sync with LD core</li>\n<li>Fixed before and after expiry notification is not sent when user re-enrolls</li>\n<li>Fixed issue when drip lesson triggered for all lessons</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.5.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added a filter to switch the notification content to RTL learndash<em>notifications</em>email_rtl</li>\n<li>Updated the trigger &quot;user hasn&#039;t logged in for X days&quot; to group the emails into one rather than sending out mass separate emails</li>\n<li>Fixed Notification for drip lesson doesn&#039;t update the send time if enrollment date gets changed</li>\n<li>Fixed PHP warnings/notices</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:52:\"Send email notifications based on LearnDash actions.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:91:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-notifications_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:91:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-notifications_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:92:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-notifications_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:5:\"4.7.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:53:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/learndash-notifications/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:21:\"notifications, emails\";s:4:\"slug\";s:23:\"learndash-notifications\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:25:\"learndash-paidmemberships\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"PaidMembershipsPro for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:62;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.3.5\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:98:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-paidmemberships/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2022-10-28 12:08:31\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:756:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Paid Memberships Pro.\r\n\r\nPaidMemberships Pro is one of the most popular free membership plugins available for WordPress with robust user statistics and reporting of membership levels.\r\n\r\nWith this integration, you can create membership level access and associate the access levels to LearnDash courses. Customers are auto-enrolled into courses after signing-up for membership.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Associate membership levels to one or more courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Auto-expire membership levels after X amount of time</li>\r\n 	<li>Create trial membership levels with various payment gateways</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/paidmembershipspro/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:441:\"<strong>1.3.5</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added additional non validated email user check to sync with LD course access</li>\n<li>Updated display email confirmation message to groups associated courses</li>\n<li>Fixed non validated emails getting course access</li>\n<li>Fixed PHPDOC block value</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.3.4</strong><br/>\n<br/><strong>1.3.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed compatibility issue with PHP versions less than 7.3</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:50:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Paid Memberships Pro.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:93:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-paidmemberships_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:93:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-paidmemberships_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:94:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-paidmemberships_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:48:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/paidmembershipspro/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:46:\"integration, membership, paid memberships pro,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:25:\"learndash-paidmemberships\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:21:\"learndash-woocommerce\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"WooCommerce for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:60;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"2.0.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:94:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-woocommerce/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.4\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-11-06 13:01:21\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:655:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with WooCommerce.\r\n\r\nWooCommerce is the most popular shopping cart software for WordPress. Most WordPress themes are compatible with WooCommerce. This add-on allows you to sell your LearnDash created courses with the WooCommerce shopping cart.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Easily map courses to products</li>\r\n 	<li>Associate one, or multiple courses to a single product</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatic course access removal</li>\r\n 	<li>Works with any payment gateway</li>\r\n 	<li>Works with WooCommerce Subscription</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/woocommerce/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:3944:\"<strong>2.0.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Fixed the issue with Woo Subscriptions renewal removing access to an enrolled group when the &quot;On Hold&quot; subscription status option is set to &quot;Deny&quot;.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.0.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Set &#039;On hold&#039; subscription status to Grant by default to prevent students from losing access in a subscription renewal process.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.0.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Feature - Added support for WooCommerce guest checkout for non-LearnDash products.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added feature to force customers to log in or create an account during checkout if cart contains product with LearnDash course or group.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added enrollment status settings to control course enrollment status based on WooCommerce order and subscription status.</li>\n<li>Feature - Added LearnDash WooCommerce settings menu and pages.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Updated retroactive access tool to use background processing with action scheduler instead of AJAX batch processing so that it can handle high numbers of orders without users waiting for it to complete.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added admin notice if WooCommerce guest checkout is enabled.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added actions: <code>learndash_woocommerce_order_refund_after</code>, <code>learndash_woocommerce_uninstall</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added filters: <code>learndash_woocommerce_order_refund_skip</code>, <code>learndash_woocommerce_product_add_to_cart_text</code>, <code>learndash_woocommerce_product_add_to_cart_url</code>, <code>learndash_woocommerce_registration_required</code>, <code>learndash_woocommerce_retroactive_access_tool_per_batch</code>.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added functions: <code>learndash_woocommerce_extra_autoloading</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.8.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Support adding/removing courses/groups to a variable product variation.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.8</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Retroactive tool no longer enrolls users into an already expired course.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.7</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Compatibility with WooCommerce High Performance Order Storage (HPOS).</li>\n<li>Fix - Remove password field on guest checkout for non associated course product.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.6</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed fatal error on checkout with WooCommerce subscriptions plugin</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.5</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added handle order/subscription item addition and removal</li>\n<li>Added add support for partial order refund</li>\n<li>Updated POT file</li>\n<li>Fixed group field selector returns empty result for shop manager</li>\n<li>Fixed update select2 version to full version to fix conflict issue</li>\n<li>Fixed conflict with other plugin because we didn&#039;t check if array index exists</li>\n<li>Fixed remove user login notice and change the logic by always enable registration setting if user cart contains LD course/group</li>\n<li>Fixed login notice always appear on cartflows checkout</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.4.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed require login notice always appear on some themes that don&#039;t pass createaccount input data</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added cron function to update active members course access in the background preventing timeout error</li>\n<li>Added silent course enrollment and improve cron object access update</li>\n<li>Updated change option and method name</li>\n<li>Updated membership change doesn&#039;t affect user manual course/group enrollment</li>\n<li>Updated change retroactive tool basis to membership rather than order</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined index error </li>\n<li>Fixed fatal error due to undefined method call</li>\n<li>Fixed remove old levels course/group associations only if Multiple Memberships addon is not active</li>\n<li>Fixed warnings and errors</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.3.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed checking logic to prevent errors</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:41:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with WooCommerce.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:89:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-woocommerce_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:89:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-woocommerce_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:90:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-woocommerce_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:41:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/woocommerce/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:25:\"integration, woocommerce,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"learndash-woocommerce\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:19:\"learndash-2checkout\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"2Checkout for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:59;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:7:\"1.1.1.2\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:92:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-2checkout/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"4.9\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2023-06-01 16:04:11\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:487:\"Integrate 2checkout payment gateway with LearnDash.\r\n\r\nUsing this add-on, you can quickly and easily accept payments using the 2CheckOut payment gateway. Use it with PayPal, or just use 2CheckOut the choice is yours!\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Use 2Checkout to sell courses</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatically delivers username and password</li>\r\n 	<li>Hassle-free set-up</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/2checkout/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:534:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\nDeactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\nDownload the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\nUpload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\nActivate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:215:\"<strong>1.1.1.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Update - Move settings tab into LearnDash LMS &gt; Settings &gt; Payments menu.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.1.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Updated security review changes</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:51:\"Integrate 2checkout payment gateway with LearnDash.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-2checkout_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:87:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-2checkout_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:88:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-2checkout_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:5:\"2.5.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:39:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/2checkout/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:26:\"payment gateway, 2checkout\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"learndash-2checkout\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:29:\"learndash-certificate-builder\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:29:\"LearnDash Certificate Builder\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:58;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:7:\"1.1.3.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:102:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-certificate-builder/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2024-11-20 17:14:13\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:542:\"Create certificates using the Gutenberg block editor.\r\n\r\nThis add-on enables a new level of certificate creation utilizing the WordPress block editor to give you a real time visual drag and drop interface for building your certificates quickly and easily.\r\n<h4>Add-on Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Drag and drop certificate builder</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with all standard Gutenberg features</li>\r\n 	<li>Live preview available</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/certificate-builder/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:534:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\nDeactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\nDownload the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\nUpload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\nActivate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:2006:\"<strong>1.1.3.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Resolved a fatal error when rendering certificate download URLs.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Resolved an issue where certificate image upload doesn&#039;t attach it to the post directly.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved conflict with LearnDash Integrity hotlinking prevention feature that disabled an image from being loaded in a certificate.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added support for .PNG background images.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Resolved an issue where certificate image upload doesn&#039;t attach it to the post directly.</li>\n<li>Fix - Resolved conflict with LearnDash Integrity hotlinking prevention feature that disabled an image from being loaded in a certificate.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added support for .PNG background images.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Tweak - Added the ability to filter the blocks that can be used within the certificate builder.</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added filters: <code>learndash_certificate_builder_allowed_blocks</code>, <code>learndash_certificate_builder_block_fallback</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix = Resolved missing blocks on widgets block editor page.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.1.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Resolved fatal error related to non-prefixed Composer dependencies</li>\n<li>Tweak - Added actions: <code>learndash_certificate_builder_uninstall</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.4</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Show certificate background image when site is using self signed SSL certificate.</li>\n<li>Fix - Certificate displaying on multiple pages when using the columns block.</li>\n<li>Fix - Linebreaks breaking up words instead of moving to the next line.</li>\n<li>Fix - LearnDash Integrity prevent hotlinking feature causing background images to not display.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.0.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added support for WordPress 5.8</li>\n<li>Fixed font conflict with the Gutenberg plugin</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:53:\"Create certificates using the Gutenberg block editor.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-default_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:76:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/ld-plugin-image.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:48:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/certificate-builder\";s:4:\"tags\";s:52:\"certificates, course certificates, quiz certificates\";s:4:\"slug\";s:29:\"learndash-certificate-builder\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:16:\"learndash-stripe\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Stripe for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:56;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:5:\"1.9.3\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:89:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-stripe/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:3:\"7.0\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2023-01-19 16:56:56\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:592:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Stripe.\r\n\r\nLearnDash comes with the ability to accept payment for courses by leveraging PayPal. Using this add-on, you can quickly and easily accept payments using the Stripe payment gateway. Use it with PayPal, or just use Stripe - the choice is yours!\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Accept payments using Stripe</li>\r\n 	<li>Automatic user creation and enrollment</li>\r\n 	<li>Compatible with built-in PayPal option</li>\r\n 	<li>Lightbox overlay</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/stripe/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:542:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\n 	Deactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\n 	Download the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\n 	Upload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\n 	Activate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:611:\"<strong>1.9.3</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added coupon support</li>\n<li>Added support to the new LearnDash global default currency configuration</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>1.9.2</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fixed PHP notice in legacy checkout</li>\n<li>Fixed empty amount in transaction record for recurring payments</li>\n<li>Fixed incorrect label on translations page</li>\n<li>Fixed Stripe payment button not honoring the &quot;active&quot; status for the gateway to be active or inactive</li>\n<li>Fixed LearnDash purchase emails not sending </li>\n<li>Fixed checkout not working for amounts under 10 in any currency</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:36:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Stripe.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:84:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-stripe_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:84:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-stripe_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-stripe_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:36:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/stripe/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:36:\"integration, payment gateway, stripe\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"learndash-stripe\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}s:16:\"learndash-zapier\";a:20:{s:4:\"name\";s:20:\"Zapier for LearnDash\";s:10:\"project_id\";i:55;s:14:\"latest_version\";s:7:\"2.3.0.1\";s:12:\"download_url\";s:89:\"https://checkout.learndash.com/wp-json/learndash/v2/repo/plugin/learndash-zapier/download\";s:8:\"requires\";s:3:\"5.0\";s:6:\"tested\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"requires_php\";s:1:\"7\";s:12:\"last_updated\";s:19:\"2023-06-01 16:05:24\";s:8:\"sections\";a:3:{s:11:\"description\";s:691:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Zapier.\r\n\r\nZapier is a service that makes it easy for you to connect two applications without the need to know code, currently with a library of over 300 applications. Zapier calls these connections Zaps, and this integration lets you create Zaps that include LearnDash activities.\r\n<h4>Integration Features</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Perform actions in over 300 applications based on seven specific LearnDash activities</li>\r\n 	<li>Supports both global and specific LearnDash activity</li>\r\n 	<li>Easily connect LearnDash to the popular Zapier program without code</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nSee the <a href=\"https://learndash.com/add-on/zapier/\">Add-on</a> page for more information.\";s:12:\"installation\";s:534:\"If the auto-update is not working, verify that you have a valid LearnDash LMS license via LEARNDASH LMS &gt; SETTINGS &gt; LMS LICENSE.\r\n\r\nAlternatively, you always have the option to update manually. Please note, a full backup of your site is always recommended prior to updating.\r\n\r\nDeactivate and delete your current version of the add-on.\r\nDownload the latest version of the add-on from our support site.\r\nUpload the zipped file via PLUGINS &gt; ADD NEW, or to wp-content/plugins.\r\nActivate the add-on plugin via the PLUGINS menu.\";s:9:\"changelog\";s:1239:\"<strong>2.3.0.1</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Fix - Add priority to <code>api_endpoint</code> method to increase stability with other plugins.</li>\n</ul>\n<br/><strong>2.3.0</strong><br/><ul>\n<li>Added quiz filter before sending trigger</li>\n<li>Added topic filter before sending trigger</li>\n<li>Added lesson filter before sending trigger</li>\n<li>Added groups ids filter</li>\n<li>Added get object list methods and update get sample to use courses_ids arg</li>\n<li>Added get courses list trigger handler and add filter course before sending triggers</li>\n<li>Updated return object list in ascending title order</li>\n<li>Updated add trigger arguments to pull sample</li>\n<li>Updated add request and payload arguments to polling triggers</li>\n<li>Updated get object sample based on selected objects</li>\n<li>Updated improve triggers hook filter before being sent</li>\n<li>Fixed quiz completed zap is not triggered after taking a quiz</li>\n<li>Fixed PHP warning for uncountable object</li>\n<li>Fixed get object list methods may return data in incorrect format</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined property error</li>\n<li>Fixed undefined variable</li>\n<li>Fixed make sure only return quiz result sample if it has same keys and value types as live data</li>\n</ul>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:36:\"Integrate LearnDash LMS with Zapier.\";s:7:\"banners\";a:2:{s:3:\"low\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"high\";s:84:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-zapier_banner.jpg\";}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:1:{i:0;s:84:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-zapier_banner.jpg\";}s:5:\"icons\";a:1:{s:7:\"default\";s:85:\"https://plugins.learndash.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/learndash-zapier_256x256.jpg\";}s:6:\"author\";s:9:\"LearnDash\";s:10:\"author_uri\";s:26:\"https://www.learndash.com/\";s:11:\"requires_ld\";s:3:\"3.0\";s:10:\"plugin_uri\";s:48:\"https://learndash.com/add-on/zapier-integration/\";s:4:\"tags\";s:20:\"integration, zapier,\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"learndash-zapier\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:8:\"standard\";}}s:10:\"last_check\";i:1734907150;}','off'),
